{
  "version": 1,
  "about": "Pinned network operations for each EAL network-shape plugin a beacon can perform (core/eal_simulator/wire_plan.py). Each case gives a plugin, its params and a seed; `ops` is what the renderer must produce and what the beacon must perform, in order; `allowlist` is every destination those operations touch. Read by tests/eal_simulator/test_wire_plan.py and agent/ealrelay/ops_test.go. Hosts are .test names and TEST-NET addresses: nothing here is ever contacted.",
